<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Itron reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Itron reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it downgraded Itron Inc to underperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said that based on weak near-term outlook and delayed growth prospects, &quot;we believe the shares are likely to decline until earnings improve.&quot;</p>
<p>-- on Wednesday, company reported fourth quarter loss of $0.17 per share versus profit $0.21 a year ago, and said it expects to show a marked improvement, including a return to profitability in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares closed down 1-1/8 to $20 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
